src/vendor/mcode-background-task/ contains eight files copied from
packages/agent-modules/background-task/src: types.ts, status.ts, id.ts,
errors.ts, manager.ts, in-memory-store.ts, in-memory-output-store.ts and index.ts.
Relative import and export suffixes change from `.js` to `.ts`. One constructor
parameter property in errors.ts becomes an explicit field and assignment.
These changes permit native Node type stripping and preserve behavior.

Role prompts are adapted from packages/local-runtime-v2/assets/agents/.
Task contracts also reference packages/local-runtime/src/background-task,
packages/local-runtime/src/api/local-task-append.ts and
packages/shared/src/subagent-roles.ts.

upstream.lock.json records the current revision, file hashes and watched
contracts. The Pi SDK integration, scheduling, persistence and notification
code are host adaptations. This package does not include a Pi runtime.
